description:
Design a 4-bit binary counter that increments its value on each positive edge of the clock signal (CLK). It resets to zero when the active low reset signal (RSTB) is asserted. The current count value is output as a 4-bit vector (Q).
module top_module(
  input CLK,
  input RSTB,
  output [3:0] Q
);

code:
module top_module(
  input CLK,
  input RSTB,
  output [3:0] Q
);reg [3:0] count;

  always @(posedge CLK) begin
    if (!RSTB) begin
      count <= 4'b0000;
    end else begin
      count <= count + 4'b0001;
    end
  end

  assign Q = count;

endmodule

